<Layout>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-24 px-8">
    <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-charcoal mb-8">Built by two professionals who wanted to build something of their own.</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-charcoal font-sans space-y-6">
      <p>Chris and Vianca Quintana are professionals, entrepreneurs, parents, and business owners. They are driven by a long-term vision to build businesses, create assets, and establish opportunities that extend beyond one generation.</p>
      <p>Their journey began with immigrating to Canada, where they built successful professional careers while simultaneously laying the groundwork for their entrepreneurial pursuits. Driven by a desire for flexibility and long-term impact, they launched their first business, which has since grown into a broader portfolio of ventures.</p>
      <p>Today, they continue to develop businesses with a steadfast commitment to craftsmanship, professionalism, and sustainable growth.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
